n":{"value":"spectrefa- spectre-fa-solid-1","library":"spectre-fontawesome"},"title_text":"Restore Cooling and Comfort","description_text":"A properly repaired system can cool more evenly, improve airflow, and help your home or business feel comfortable again during hot North Carolina weather.\n","__globals__":{"primary_color":"globals\/colors?id=accent","title_color":"globals\/colors?id=408e485","hover_title_color":"globals\/colors?id=408e485","description_color":"globals\/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"icon-box","elType":"widget"},{"id":"10f3f8d1","settings":{"selected_icon":{"value":"spectrefa- spectre-fa-solid-2","library":"spectre-fontawesome"},"title_text":"Improve Energy Efficiency","description_text":"When your AC is struggling, it often runs longer than it should. Fixing airflow, electrical, refrigerant, or coil issues can help reduce wasted energy.","__globals__":{"primary_color":"globals\/colors?id=accent","title_color":"globals\/colors?id=408e485","hover_title_color":"globals\/colors?id=408e485","description_color":"globals\/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"icon-box","elType":"widget"},{"id":"588b69f3","settings":{"selected_icon":{"value":"spectrefa- spectre-fa-solid-3","library":"spectre-fontawesome"},"title_text":"Prevent Bigger Breakdowns","description_text":"Small AC problems can create strain on major components. Repairing issues early can help prevent damage to compressors, motors, and electrical parts.","__globals__":{"primary_color":"globals\/colors?id=accent","title_color":"globals\/colors?id=408e485","hover_title_color":"globals\/colors?id=408e485","description_color":"globals\/colors?id=text"}},"elements":[],"isInner":false,"widgetType":"icon-box","elType":"widget"},{"id":"210734ec","settings":{"selected_icon":{"value":"spectrefa- spectre-fa-solid-4","library":"spectre-fontawesome"},"title_text":"Support Better Indoor Air Quality","description_text":"A repair visit can uncover dirty f